---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import { CHIME_TASKS, CHIME_SOURCES, chimePrompt } from '../lib/chime';
import waveform from '../data/chime-waveform.json';
const maxHeight = (h: number) => Math.max(2, h);
const title = 'Chime · the sound of a connection';
const description = 'An open PointCast project for discovering audiovisual equipment through sound. Hear the first packet, bring your AI, and work in public.';
---
<BlockLayout title={title} description={description} hideAds showNetworkStrip={false} alternates={[{type:'application/json',href:'/chime.json',title:'Chime project brief'},{type:'text/markdown',href:'/chime/brief.md',title:'Bring your AI to Chime'}]}>
  <main class="chime" data-chime>
    <nav class="project-nav" aria-label="Chime navigation"><a class="wordmark" href="/">PointCast<span> / Chime</span></a><div><a href="#work">Open work</a><a href="#notebook">Notebook</a><a href="#bring-ai">Bring your AI ↗</a></div></nav>
    <header class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">OPEN PROJECT 001 · SOUND / DEVICES / PEOPLE</p><h1>A little sound.<br />A new connection.</h1><div class="intro-bottom"><p>What if your speakers, headphones and other equipment could introduce themselves by ear? <strong>Let’s build it, in public.</strong></p><span class="stage">CHIME / EXPERIMENT 0.1</span></div></header>
    <div class="workbench">
      <section class="signal" aria-labelledby="signal-title"><div class="signal-top"><span class="eyebrow">FIRST SIGNAL</span><span class="eyebrow">01 ↔ 02</span></div><h2 id="signal-title">Hello. I hear you.</h2><div class="wave" aria-hidden="true">{waveform.map(h=><i style={`--h:${maxHeight(h)}%`}></i>)}</div><div class="signal-labels"><span>HELLO</span><span>pause</span><span>ACK</span></div><audio controls preload="metadata" src="/chime/chime-demo.wav" aria-label="Play the Chime HELLO and ACK data packets"></audio><p class="signal-note">Two real data packets. One 5.48-second sample.<br />Start with your volume low.</p><p class="proof">Software decode checked. The reply in this sample is generated; no second device is listening.</p><div class="signal-links"><a href="/chime/chime-demo.wav" download>Download WAV</a><a href="/chime/chime-checks.json">See the checks ↗</a></div></section>
      <section class="ai-desk" id="bring-ai"><p class="eyebrow">YOUR AI HAS A SEAT HERE</p><h2>Bring your AI.<br />Leave something useful.</h2><p>Take one small question to the AI you already use. Return with a test, a sketch, a piece of code, or a better question.</p><label for="chime-task">Choose a starting point</label><select id="chime-task">{CHIME_TASKS.map(t=><option value={t.id}>{t.title}</option>)}</select><textarea id="chime-invitation" readonly rows="5" aria-label="Invitation to copy into your AI">{chimePrompt()}</textarea><div class="actions"><button class="primary" type="button" data-copy>Copy invitation</button><a href="/chime/brief.md">Read the brief ↗</a></div><p class="copy-status" data-copy-status role="status">Your AI runs in its own app. Review its work before posting.</p><a class="setup-link" href="/connectors">Already use PointCast with your AI? Connection guide ↗</a></section>
    </div>
    <section class="principle"><p class="eyebrow">THE IDEA</p><h2>Sound opens the door.<br />The connection comes next.</h2><p>A short chirp carries an invitation. A compatible listener answers. You decide whether to connect. Audio, video and controls can then travel over a supported network or cable.</p></section>
    <section class="paths" aria-label="Equipment paths"><article><span class="path-number">01 / AIR</span><h3>Speakers & rooms</h3><p>A speaker plays the hello. A phone, computer or small listening bridge decodes it.</p><small>Needs receiver software + a microphone.</small></article><article><span class="path-number">02 / COMPANION</span><h3>Headphones & personal gear</h3><p>Your phone or computer represents the connected headphones. It can listen and ask which output to use.</p><small>No promise that every headset can hear or pair itself.</small></article><article><span class="path-number">03 / CABLE</span><h3>Interfaces & other equipment</h3><p>A bridge could send the same message through an audio path and identify which route reached a receiver.</p><small>Proposed. Needs electrical and routing tests.</small></article></section>
    <section class="open-work" id="work"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">MAKE THE NEXT THING TRUE</p><h2>Four open questions.</h2></div><p>No claimed compatibility yet.<br />Small, reproducible results welcome.</p></div><div class="task-grid">{CHIME_TASKS.map((t,i)=><article class="task" id={`task-${t.id}`}><div class="task-meta"><span>0{i+1} / {t.tag}</span><span>{t.status}</span></div><h3>{t.title}</h3><p class="task-question">{t.question}</p><p>{t.deliverable}</p><button type="button" data-task={t.id}>Work on this with my AI ↗</button></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="notebook" id="notebook"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A SHARED RECORD</p><h2>The public notebook.</h2></div><button type="button" class="text-button" data-refresh>Refresh entries ↻</button></div><div class="notebook-grid"><div><article class="founding-note"><div class="entry-meta">PROJECT NOTE · CODEX · SEPTEMBER 15, 2026</div><h3>The first hello is a software proof.</h3><p>A 20-byte invitation and matching reply were encoded with ggwave and recovered from the saved waveform. Checks include packet damage, mismatched replies and added noise.</p><p>Next: send it through an actual speaker and microphone. Range, noisy rooms, headphones, and secure pairing are still open work.</p><a href="/chime/chime-checks.json">Read the experiment record ↗</a></article><div class="entries" data-entries aria-live="polite"><p>Loading community entries…</p></div><button class="text-button" type="button" data-more hidden>Older entries ↓</button></div><form class="contribute" data-contribution><h3>Add a finding.</h3><p>Published for everyone to read. Names and AI credits are self-reported; contributions are not independently verified.</p><div class="field-row"><label>Your name or handle<input name="author" required maxlength="60" autocomplete="nickname" /></label><label>AI used <span>(optional)</span><input name="ai" maxlength="60" placeholder="e.g. Claude, ChatGPT, Codex" /></label></div><div class="field-row"><label>Task<select name="task">{CHIME_TASKS.map(t=><option value={t.id}>{t.title}</option>)}</select></label><label>Contribution<select name="kind"><option value="proposal">Proposal</option><option value="test">Test result</option><option value="question">Question</option><option value="artifact">Code or artifact</option></select></label></div><label>What did you learn?<textarea name="text" required maxlength="1800" rows="5" placeholder="What you tried, what happened, and what is still uncertain."></textarea></label><label>Public evidence link <span>(optional)</span><input name="url" type="url" maxlength="500" placeholder="https://…" /></label><label class="consent"><input name="consent" type="checkbox" required /> I reviewed this contribution and want to publish it.</label><button class="primary" type="submit">Publish contribution</button><p data-post-status role="status">Six posts per hour per network address. Entries stay for 90 days. Keep lasting work in a pull request.</p></form></div></section>
    <section class="spec"><div><p class="eyebrow">OPEN MATERIALS</p><h2>Take it apart.<br />Make it better.</h2><p>The name and protocol are provisional. Compatible software or an adapter is needed; playing a chirp does not turn ordinary equipment into a network device.</p><div class="materials"><a href="/chime/brief.md">Protocol & contribution brief ↗</a><a href="/chime/chime-packet.mjs" download>Packet source ↗</a><a href="/chime/chime-experiment.mjs" download>Reproduce the experiment ↗</a><a href="/chime.json">Machine-readable project ↗</a><a href="/api/chime/log">Public notebook API ↗</a><a href="https://github.com/mhoydich/pointcast">PointCast source / pull requests ↗</a></div></div><div><p class="eyebrow">BUILT WITH, AND LEARNING FROM</p>{CHIME_SOURCES.map(s=><article class="source"><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{s.title} ↗</a><p>{s.note}</p></article>)}<p class="boundary">A sound exchange is not identity proof. Authentication, replay protection and permission to control equipment need their own design.</p></div></section>
    <footer class="project-end"><a href="/">A PointCast project</a><span>Humans + AIs · Work in the open</span><a href="#bring-ai">Pull up a chair ↗</a></footer>
  </main>
</BlockLayout>
<script>
  import { chimePrompt } from '../lib/chime';
  function mountChime() {
    const root = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-chime]'); if (!root || root.dataset.mounted) return; root.dataset.mounted = 'true';
    const task = root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('#chime-task')!, invitation = root.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('#chime-invitation')!, copyStatus = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-copy-status]')!;
    task.addEventListener('change', () => { invitation.value = chimePrompt(task.value); });
    root.querySelector('[data-copy]')!.addEventListener('click', async () => { try { await navigator.clipboard.writeText(invitation.value); copyStatus.textContent = 'Copied. Paste it into your AI and choose one useful result.'; } catch { invitation.focus(); invitation.select(); copyStatus.textContent = 'Select and copy the invitation above.'; } });
    root.querySelectorAll<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-task]').forEach(b => b.addEventListener('click', () => { task.value = b.dataset.task!; invitation.value = chimePrompt(task.value); root.querySelector<HTMLSelectElement>('select[name="task"]')!.value = task.value; document.getElementById('bring-ai')!.scrollIntoView({ behavior: matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches ? 'instant' : 'smooth' }); task.focus({preventScroll:true}); }));
    const entries = root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-entries]')!, more = root.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('[data-more]')!;
    let cursor: string | null = null, loading = false;
    const seen = new Set<string>();
    const recent = new Map<string, Record<string,string>>();
    function renderEntry(e: Record<string,string>, prepend = false) {
      if (seen.has(e.id)) return; seen.add(e.id);
      const article = document.createElement('article'); article.className = 'entry'; article.id = `note-${e.id}`;
      const meta = document.createElement('p'); meta.className = 'entry-meta'; meta.textContent = `${e.kind} / ${e.task} · ${e.author}${e.ai ? ' + ' + e.ai : ''} · ${new Date(e.at).toLocaleDateString()}`;
      const body = document.createElement('p'); body.className='entry-body'; body.textContent=e.text; article.append(meta,body);
      if (e.url) { try { const url = new URL(e.url); if(url.protocol==='https:' && !url.username && !url.password) { const link=document.createElement('a'); link.href=url.href; link.textContent='Public evidence ↗'; link.target='_blank'; link.rel='noopener noreferrer nofollow ugc'; article.append(link); } } catch {} }
      const receipt = document.createElement('a'); receipt.href=`/api/chime/log?id=${encodeURIComponent(e.id)}`; receipt.textContent='Receipt ↗'; receipt.className='receipt'; article.append(receipt);
      if(prepend) entries.prepend(article); else entries.append(article);
    }
    async function load(older=false) {
      if(loading) return; loading=true; more.disabled=true;
      try { const res=await fetch('/api/chime/log'+(older && cursor ? '?cursor='+encodeURIComponent(cursor):''),{headers:{accept:'application/json'}}); const data=await res.json(); if(!res.ok || !data.ok || !Array.isArray(data.entries)) throw new Error(data.error || 'The notebook is unavailable.');
        if(!older){entries.replaceChildren();seen.clear(); [...recent.values()].sort((a,b)=>b.at.localeCompare(a.at)).forEach(e=>renderEntry(e));} data.entries.forEach((e:Record<string,string>)=>{renderEntry(e);if(recent.has(e.id))recent.delete(e.id);});
        if(!seen.size){const p=document.createElement('p');p.dataset.empty='true';p.textContent='No community findings yet. The first real room test has a place here.';entries.append(p);}
        cursor=data.nextCursor;more.hidden=!cursor;
      } catch(e) { if(!older){entries.replaceChildren(); const p=document.createElement('p');p.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Could not load entries.';entries.append(p);} }
      finally{loading=false;more.disabled=false;}
    }
    root.querySelector('[data-refresh]')!.addEventListener('click',()=>void load()); more.addEventListener('click',()=>void load(true)); void load();
    const form=root.querySelector<HTMLFormElement>('[data-contribution]')!, status=root.querySelector<HTMLElement>('[data-post-status]')!;
    form.addEventListener('submit',async(event)=>{event.preventDefault();const button=form.querySelector<HTMLButtonElement>('button[type="submit"]')!;if(button.disabled)return;const data=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form).entries());button.disabled=true;status.textContent='Saving your public contribution…';
      try{const res=await fetch('/api/chime/log',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...data,consent:data.consent==='on'})});const result=await res.json();if(!res.ok||!result.ok||!result.entry)throw new Error(result.error||'Could not save. Check the notebook before retrying.');entries.querySelector('[data-empty]')?.remove();recent.set(result.entry.id,result.entry);renderEntry(result.entry,true);status.textContent='Published. Your receipt: ';const a=document.createElement('a');a.href=result.receipt;a.textContent=result.entry.id;status.append(a);form.querySelector<HTMLTextAreaElement>('[name="text"]')!.value='';form.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('[name="consent"]')!.checked=false;
      }catch(e){status.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Could not confirm storage. Check the notebook before retrying.';}finally{button.disabled=false;}
    });
  }
  mountChime(); document.addEventListener('astro:page-load',mountChime);
</script>
<style>
  .chime{--ink:#111827;--blue:#254de5;--lime:#d9f76b;max-width:1180px;margin:auto;padding:0 32px 95px;color:var(--ink);font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6}.chime *{box-sizing:border-box}.chime a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:4px}.project-nav{min-height:82px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd0d8;gap:24px}.wordmark{font-weight:800;text-decoration:none;font-size:22px}.wordmark span{font-weight:400}.project-nav div{display:flex;gap:24px;font-size:14px}.project-nav div a{text-decoration:none}.eyebrow,.stage,.task-meta,.path-number,.chime :global(.entry-meta){font-family:'JetBrains Mono Variable',monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.04em}.intro{padding:42px 0 32px}.intro .eyebrow{color:var(--blue)}h1{font-size:clamp(44px,6.4vw,76px);font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.055em;line-height:1.04;margin:18px 0 22px}.intro-bottom{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:32px;align-items:end}.intro-bottom p{max-width:640px;margin:0;font-size:18px}.stage{white-space:nowrap;padding-bottom:3px}h2{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1.13;font-weight:550;margin:16px 0 24px}h3{font-size:23px;letter-spacing:-.025em;line-height:1.25;margin:16px 0}.workbench{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.signal{background:#132022;color:#eff5e9;padding:30px;min-width:0}.signal-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--lime)}.signal h2{font-size:38px}.wave{height:124px;display:flex;gap:3px;align-items:center;margin:25px 0 5px}.wave i{flex:1;height:var(--h);background:var(--lime);min-width:1px}.signal-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:#c2d19c;font-family:monospace;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:24px}.signal audio{width:100%;height:44px}.signal-note{font-size:15px;margin:14px 0;color:#e1e8dc}.proof{font-size:14px;color:#c0cfcc;border-top:1px solid #425151;padding-top:16px;line-height:1.5}.signal-links{display:flex;gap:24px;font-size:14px}.ai-desk{padding:26px 28px;background:#eef2ff;min-width:0;scroll-margin-top:24px}.ai-desk .eyebrow{color:var(--blue);margin-top:0}.ai-desk h2{margin:12px 0 18px}.ai-desk p{margin:10px 0 20px}.ai-desk label,.contribute label{display:block;font-size:14px;font-weight:550;margin-bottom:8px}.chime input,.chime textarea,.chime select{font:inherit;font-size:16px;color:var(--ink);padding:10px 12px;border:1px solid #acb7ca;background:#fff;border-radius:3px;width:100%;max-width:100%}.chime textarea{resize:vertical}.ai-desk textarea{font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0}.chime button{font:inherit;cursor:pointer}.chime button:disabled{cursor:wait;opacity:.65}.actions{display:flex;gap:20px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap}.actions a,.setup-link{font-size:14px}.primary{background:var(--blue);color:white;border:0;padding:12px 20px;border-radius:3px;font-weight:600}.ai-desk .copy-status{font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;margin:12px 0}.principle{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1.1fr 1.1fr;gap:32px;padding:52px 0 30px;align-items:start}.principle h2{margin:0;font-size:30px}.principle p{margin:0}.paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;border-top:1px solid #cbd0d8;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd0d8;padding:30px 0}.path-number{color:var(--blue)}.paths p{font-size:15px}.paths small{font-size:13px;display:block;color:#526071}.section-heading{display:flex;align-items:end;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px;margin:0 0 28px}.section-heading h2{margin:8px 0 0}.section-heading p{margin:0}.section-heading>p{font-size:14px;color:#526071}.open-work,.notebook{padding-top:58px;scroll-margin-top:24px}.task-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #cbd0d8;border-left:1px solid #cbd0d8}.task{padding:26px;border-bottom:1px solid #cbd0d8;border-right:1px solid #cbd0d8}.task-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;color:#526071;flex-wrap:wrap}.task-question{font-size:18px}.task p:not(.task-question){font-size:15px;color:#526071}.task button,.text-button{background:none;border:0;color:var(--blue);padding:8px 0;text-align:left;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:5px;min-height:44px}.notebook-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:40px}.founding-note{border-left:3px solid var(--blue);padding:0 0 0 24px}.founding-note p{font-size:15px}.chime :global(.entry-meta){color:#526071;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.chime :global(.entry){padding:24px 0;border-top:1px solid #cbd0d8}.chime :global(.entry-body){white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.chime :global(.entry a){font-size:14px;color:var(--blue)}.chime :global(.receipt){margin-left:18px}.entries{margin-top:28px}.contribute{background:#f3f5f7;padding:24px;min-width:0}.contribute h3{margin-top:0}.contribute>p{font-size:14px;color:#526071}.field-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px}.contribute label{margin-top:12px}.contribute label span{font-weight:400;color:#526071}.contribute label input,.contribute label select,.contribute label textarea{display:block;margin-top:6px}.contribute .consent{display:flex;align-items:start;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.contribute .consent input{width:19px;height:19px;margin:3px 0 0;flex-shrink:0}.contribute [data-post-status]{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5}.spec{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:64px;border-top:1px solid #cbd0d8;margin-top:60px;padding:44px 0}.spec>div>p{max-width:480px}.materials{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:start;gap:10px;color:var(--blue);font-size:15px}.source{border-bottom:1px solid #d9dee5;padding:14px 0}.source a{font-weight:550}.source p,.boundary{font-size:14px;color:#526071;margin-bottom:0}.project-end{border-top:1px solid #cbd0d8;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:25px 0;font-size:14px}.project-end span{color:#526071}.chime :focus-visible{outline:3px solid #d45b20;outline-offset:3px}
  @media(max-width:780px){.chime{padding:0 20px 100px}.project-nav{align-items:start;padding:20px 0;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.project-nav div{gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}.intro{padding-top:28px}.intro-bottom{display:block}.stage{display:inline-block;margin-top:20px}.workbench,.notebook-grid,.spec{grid-template-columns:1fr}.principle{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:20px;padding-top:40px}.paths{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}.paths article+article{border-top:1px solid #d9dee5;padding-top:24px}.task-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-heading{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}.signal,.ai-desk{padding:24px}.notebook-grid{gap:28px}.spec{gap:32px}.field-row{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:0}.task{padding:22px}h2{font-size:32px}.intro-bottom p{font-size:17px}}
</style>
